[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11522.309, "timestamp": "03:12:02", "text": "幼児は赤ちゃんのことですよね？うん。幼児"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11524.87, "timestamp": "03:12:04", "text": "まるで学習を始めたばかりの人たちのようだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11526.71, "timestamp": "03:12:06", "text": "歩く。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11530.63, "timestamp": "03:12:10", "text": "そうそう。私はいつもそう思っていた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11534.07, "timestamp": "03:12:14", "text": "おもちゃか何かだった。人々だと思う。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11536.79, "timestamp": "03:12:16", "text": "いや、いや、いや、いや、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11539.91, "timestamp": "03:12:19", "text": "いや、いや、いや。年を取るにつれて、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11542.389, "timestamp": "03:12:22", "text": "あなたは睡眠スケジュールを整えるのに苦労している。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11545.349, "timestamp": "03:12:25", "text": "ええ、その通りです。あなたが手に入れるにつれて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11548.23, "timestamp": "03:12:28", "text": "年老いた、スポーツマン。なんてこった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11550.309, "timestamp": "03:12:30", "text": "さらに、間違った時間に食事をすると、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11551.83, "timestamp": "03:12:31", "text": "間違った時間に寝ると、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11554.63, "timestamp": "03:12:34", "text": "付録をもらうんですよね？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11558.389, "timestamp": "03:12:38", "text": "なんてこった。それもまた然り。気をつけなければならない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11560.63, "timestamp": "03:12:40", "text": "でも、自分のことは自分で気をつけなきゃいけないよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11563.429, "timestamp": "03:12:43", "text": "私たちの小さな私たちの小さな"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11568.71, "timestamp": "03:12:48", "text": "スターボーイは慎重で安全だ。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11568.819, "timestamp": "03:12:48", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ahhh where do I send it? (in server lmao) it's not exactly a fan art"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11570.23, "timestamp": "03:12:50", "text": "それは、スト